{"3545560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ironclad", "steam_appid": 3545560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironclad is a co-op horror game where you and a small crew pilot tanks to eradicate the monster infestation plaguing the world. Work together and harness ancient technology to end the scourge once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/dfde151ec080bd58e74c33de36c888b6.webp?t=1777305801\" width=183 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With  up to 6 players, drive, shoot, repair, and upgrade your tanks while traversing across a treacherous land inhabited by powerful eldritch horrors in search of the ultimate weapon. Find refuge at safe points and don't forget to keep an eye on your oxygen levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/6708819580e779c1cf55e8432ca3dcd2.poster.avif?t=1777305801\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/6708819580e779c1cf55e8432ca3dcd2.webm?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/6708819580e779c1cf55e8432ca3dcd2.mp4?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/b9056428419702bc68e06d88ce9e7866.webp?t=1777305801\" width=142 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your pick between driving and shooting in team-piloted tanks. Do you split up or stick together as you search for supplies and artifacts to combat the brutal landscape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/ffee983497c446d026a97388bbc15626.poster.avif?t=1777305801\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/ffee983497c446d026a97388bbc15626.webm?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/ffee983497c446d026a97388bbc15626.mp4?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/a3383c31229644e6d9408d81b413d686.webp?t=1777305801\" width=288 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While running might be your best option, it's not your only option. Find weapons, ammo, and health packs to fight off monsters and stay alive, even if just barely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, blow some stuff up with your tanks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/e54d61f30207a4c45e91dc43c071bd4f.poster.avif?t=1777305801\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/e54d61f30207a4c45e91dc43c071bd4f.webm?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/e54d61f30207a4c45e91dc43c071bd4f.mp4?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/6c65cc94ec1bb26f3fb5a1694bc73d85.webp?t=1777305801\" width=235 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry, if your body gets destroyed (and it will), your spirit lives on! Your friends have enough of your DNA  to construct you a new body in the resurrection pods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/272ee346bdcffdb994cdf695fb284f59.poster.avif?t=1777305801\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/272ee346bdcffdb994cdf695fb284f59.webm?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/272ee346bdcffdb994cdf695fb284f59.mp4?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironclad is a co-op horror game where you and a small crew pilot tanks to eradicate the monster infestation plaguing the world. Work together and harness ancient technology to end the scourge once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/dfde151ec080bd58e74c33de36c888b6.webp?t=1777305801\" width=183 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With  up to 6 players, drive, shoot, repair, and upgrade your tanks while traversing across a treacherous land inhabited by powerful eldritch horrors in search of the ultimate weapon. Find refuge at safe points and don't forget to keep an eye on your oxygen levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/6708819580e779c1cf55e8432ca3dcd2.poster.avif?t=1777305801\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/6708819580e779c1cf55e8432ca3dcd2.webm?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/6708819580e779c1cf55e8432ca3dcd2.mp4?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/b9056428419702bc68e06d88ce9e7866.webp?t=1777305801\" width=142 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your pick between driving and shooting in team-piloted tanks. Do you split up or stick together as you search for supplies and artifacts to combat the brutal landscape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/ffee983497c446d026a97388bbc15626.poster.avif?t=1777305801\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/ffee983497c446d026a97388bbc15626.webm?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545560/extras/ffee983497c446d026a97388bbc15626.mp4?t=1777305801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" s